                <head>Agreement between the United States and the United Kingdom governing
                    collaboration in atomic energy research and development</head>
                <p>[For text of agreement signed at Quebec, August 19, 1943, see Department of State
                    Treaties and Other International Acts Series No. 2993, or <hi
                        rendition="#italic">United States Treaties and Other International
                        Agreements</hi>, vol. 5, p. 1114. Correspondence relating to the First
                    Quebec Conference, August 17–24, 1943, at which this agreement was signed, is
                    scheduled for publication in a subsequent volume of <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Foreign Relations</hi>.]</p>
            </div>
